  "body": "#613 was closed with: \"We moved the extension classes to a separate UML package so that they are not included in the UML export and can be treated as API-only artefacts that don't need terminology.\"\n\n`dataStructure.yml` still includes both classes, in v4.0.0 and on the head of `release-4-1-0` (lines 2463 and 2531): ExtensionAttribute with 13 attributes and ExtensionClass with 4, none with a C-code or definition. As decided in #613, they have no rows in `USDM_CT.xlsx`.\n\nSo a consumer of the YAML sees two model classes without C-codes or definitions, and nothing to say they are API-only.\n\nAsk: leave them out of `dataStructure.yml`, as from the UML export, or mark them there as API-only.\n\nFound while rendering USDM v4 as RDF: https://kerfors.github.io/usdm-overlay/id/finding/extension-attributes-undefined/",
